3.6.1.63: A financial institution should establish and implement an ICT project management policy that includes as a minimum:
a. project objectives;
b. roles and responsibilities;
c. a project risk assessment;
d. a project plan, timeframe and steps;
e. key milestones;
f. change management requirements.

